{"id":"H7666","lemma":"שָׁבַר","transliteration":"shavar","sayIt":"sha-var","language":"Hebrew","partOfSpeech":"verb","gloss":"to buy grain","meaning":"1) to buy or purchase grain\n1a) (Qal) to buy grain\n1b) (Hiphil) to sell grain\nAramaic equivalent: ze.van (זְבַן \"to buy\" H2084)","glosses":["buy","buy grain","sold grain to","sold grain","here to buy","buying"],"count":20,"occurrences":[{"chapterId":"gen-41","v":56,"renderings":{"bsb":"sold grain to","kjv":"and sold"}},{"chapterId":"gen-41","v":57,"renderings":{"bsb":"to buy grain","kjv":"for to buy"}},{"chapterId":"gen-42","v":2,"renderings":{"bsb":"and buy","kjv":"and buy"}},{"chapterId":"gen-42","v":3,"renderings":{"bsb":"to buy","kjv":"to buy"}},{"chapterId":"gen-42","v":5,"renderings":{"bsb":"to buy grain","kjv":"to buy"}},{"chapterId":"gen-42","v":6,"renderings":{"bsb":"sold grain","kjv":"and he it was that sold"}},{"chapterId":"gen-42","v":7,"renderings":{"bsb":"We are here to buy","kjv":"to buy"}},{"chapterId":"gen-42","v":10,"renderings":{"bsb":"to buy","kjv":"but to buy"}},{"chapterId":"gen-43","v":2,"renderings":{"bsb":"and buy","kjv":"buy"}},{"chapterId":"gen-43","v":4,"renderings":{"bsb":"and buy","kjv":"and buy"}},{"chapterId":"gen-43","v":20,"renderings":{"bsb":"to buy","kjv":"to buy"}},{"chapterId":"gen-43","v":22,"renderings":{"bsb":"to buy","kjv":"to buy"}},{"chapterId":"gen-44","v":25,"renderings":{"bsb":"and buy","kjv":"and buy"}},{"chapterId":"gen-47","v":14,"renderings":{"bsb":"were buying","kjv":"which they bought"}},{"chapterId":"deu-2","v":6,"renderings":{"bsb":"You are to pay","kjv":"Ye shall buy"}},{"chapterId":"deu-2","v":28,"renderings":{"bsb":"You can sell us","kjv":"Thou shalt sell"}},{"chapterId":"pro-11","v":26,"renderings":{"bsb":"the one who sells it"}},{"chapterId":"isa-55","v":1,"renderings":{"bsb":"buy","kjv":"buy"}},{"chapterId":"amo-8","v":5,"renderings":{"bsb":"that we may sell","kjv":"that we may sell"}},{"chapterId":"amo-8","v":6,"renderings":{"bsb":"selling","kjv":"and